raw_documents/
# ---- Engine runtime output ----
# Transient runtime state (the learned KB, open escalations) is machine-local and stays out.
# The capability catalogue in data/artifacts/ is committed on purpose: a saved artifact is a
# required deliverable, and it is what a reviewer reads to judge the schema.
data/**/*.json
!data/artifacts/*.json


# Per-run reports and screenshots. A run writes into evidence/discovery_runs/ and
# evidence/replay_runs/, which are scratch and stay out of the repo — the directories are
# kept (via .gitkeep) so a fresh checkout has somewhere to write.
evidence/discovery_runs/**
evidence/replay_runs/**
evidence/escalations/**
!evidence/**/.gitkeep

# The curated end-to-end demonstration is committed. It is promoted here deliberately
# rather than being whatever happened to be in the scratch directories last.
!evidence/submission/**
